Ragnar was a person who had grown up in the harsh half-savage environment of the foothills, who had to fight for survival from childhood could not afford such a luxury as literacy, and there was nobody to teach him. But he had a great deal of other qualities, like enormous strength, impressive height, and a stern appearance that made an indelible mark on people: flaming lust in women and trembling fear in men. Knowing this, Ragnar was looking for a citizen sturdy enough to stay in presence of the Lemurian.